# Package ids published to nuget.org, one per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# This is the TEMPLATE REPOSITORY's own list, not the one it ships. The shipped pair lives at
# templates/bbpkg/packages.push and templates/bbpkg/packages.local and is inert content here.
#
# ⭐ This repository uses the guard it teaches. One id today is not a reason to skip it: the
# argument for skipping is always "there is only one package", which is true right up until the
# release that adds a second — and by then the habit of naming them by hand is established.
#
# ⛔ Every id here must be covered by this repository's ONE trusted-publishing policy. nuget.org
# mints one API key per token exchange scoped to one matching policy, so a policy per id does not
# work: the first id publishes permanently and the rest are rejected 403 in the same command.

Bennewitz.Ninja.Templates
